(6568473, 978150, 23439, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I really like how you did the ripped and taped look to separate the scenes. <br/> <br/>On my screen I can see a little square surrounding the moon that''s just slightly different than the rest of the sky. I''m assuming the moon was shot separately from the night picture and what I''m seeing is the square crop that was used to copy the moon into the scene? There''s also a little section about 3-4 moon widths wide and 1 high, directly above and running to the left of the moon that has the same contrast difference. Looks to me like a cloud was brushed out with a hard brush. If so using a softer brush with some feathering would have blended it into the background sky better. <br/> <br/>Gave you a 9, as I really like this. Think this would look wonderful on a big piece of canvas in someones living room.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I really like how you did the ripped and taped look to separate the scenes.  On my screen I can see a little square surrounding the moon that''s just slightly different than the rest of the sky. I''m assuming the moon was shot separately from the night picture and what I''m seeing is the square crop that was used to copy the moon into the scene? There''s also a little section about 3-4 moon widths wide and 1 high, directly above and running to the left of the moon that has the same contrast difference. Looks to me like a cloud was brushed out with a hard brush. If so using a softer brush with some feathering would have blended it into the background sky better.  Gave you a 9, as I really like this. Think this would look wonderful on a big piece of canvas in someones living room.', '2011-10-14 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
