(6573186, 978238, 114969, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic concept! I love it, makes me think about "<a href="//heymadelinesummer.blogspot.com/2010/07/le-petit-prince.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Le Petit Prince</a>" from St Exupery.<br/>That said, it''s now becoming a bad habit from you to beat me from one place, that must change! ;) Congratulations Judi!<br/> <br/>ETA: Ah, just read other comments, I see I''m not the only one seeing that reference!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-21 08:40:29.</i></td>', 'What a fantastic concept! I love it, makes me think about "Le Petit Prince" from St Exupery.That said, it''s now becoming a bad habit from you to beat me from one place, that must change! ;) Congratulations Judi! ETA: Ah, just read other comments, I see I''m not the only one seeing that reference!', '2011-10-21 09:39:43.000000', '2011-10-21 09:40:29.000000', 0),
