(6573683, 978238, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Yaaaaaaaaay!!!!!!   Adore this image, Judi.  Congrats.   As others have pointed out, it''s very reminiscent of The Little Prince.  A search returned <a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/21470442@N05/sets/72157623856995173/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">these images</a>.  Maybe the one you remember is in there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think your link was wrong...it contained wolf images.  The image I remember was like my image but the boy was standing on top of the globe with a watering can and a topiary and in full daylight.  It wasn''t in sketch form but a very detailed almost photo like image.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Yaaaaaaaaay!!!!!!   Adore this image, Judi.  Congrats.   As others have pointed out, it''s very reminiscent of The Little Prince.  A search returned these images.  Maybe the one you remember is in there.   I think your link was wrong...it contained wolf images.  The image I remember was like my image but the boy was standing on top of the globe with a watering can and a topiary and in full daylight.  It wasn''t in sketch form but a very detailed almost photo like image.', '2011-10-21 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6573705, 978666, 65319, '<td valign="top">Always my favorite shade of blue...;-)</td>', 'Always my favorite shade of blue...;-)', '2011-10-21 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6573716, 976520, 124815, '<td valign="top">John this is superb! I was one of your 9s. Did not have time to leave any comments though. The more I look at it, the more I am drawn to that door that waits to be pushed just so slightly.  On the other hand I do not want to open it since the light where we, viewers are, is so pleasant. You are in full swing of experimenting and opening new door, so to speak. I loved your String Theory also.</td>', 'John this is superb! I was one of your 9s. Did not have time to leave any comments though. The more I look at it, the more I am drawn to that door that waits to be pushed just so slightly.  On the other hand I do not want to open it since the light where we, viewers are, is so pleasant. You are in full swing of experimenting and opening new door, so to speak. I loved your String Theory also.', '2011-10-21 22:28:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6573718, 978685, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. So ghostly and mysterious.</td>', 'I really like this. So ghostly and mysterious.', '2011-10-21 22:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6573723, 978685, 124815, '<td valign="top">I was completely speechless and boy, this is quite rare for me. My mind wandered ... I was in the forest and back on one of Tarkowsky''s set for his masterpiece "The Mirror" (if you did not see it it''s a MUST along with pretty much all his movies), then in Chekhov''s world to find myself thinking of Bill Viola. <br/>Of course, when I stepped back, the spell got torn just so little ... what if you would have made the grey of the sky/ceiling and window at left more transparent ...less "applied".  What if. Oh, just forget it. (On second thoughts, do make it more transparent).<br/>Magnificent image. <br/></td>', 'I was completely speechless and boy, this is quite rare for me. My mind wandered ... I was in the forest and back on one of Tarkowsky''s set for his masterpiece "The Mirror" (if you did not see it it''s a MUST along with pretty much all his movies), then in Chekhov''s world to find myself thinking of Bill Viola. Of course, when I stepped back, the spell got torn just so little ... what if you would have made the grey of the sky/ceiling and window at left more transparent ...less "applied".  What if. Oh, just forget it. (On second thoughts, do make it more transparent).Magnificent image. ', '2011-10-21 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
